<title>SWITZERLAND: Ciba Specialty shares start at 112.75 Sfr.</title>
<headline>Ciba Specialty shares start at 112.75 Sfr.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ciba Specialty Chemicals Holding Inc shares started trading at 112.75 Swiss francs on the Swiss Exchange, above the issue price of 110 francs fixed for the company's global offering.</p>
<p>Dealers had expected Ciba SC, spun off from Novartis, to begin above the issue price.</p>
<p>Shares were quoted at 111.25 around 0910 GMT.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
